WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.990
Elite Soldier Pawn!

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:15.360
I knew it.

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:21.910
What's this?!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.400
Seidouzan suddenly brings out four Avatars!

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.710
This is a truly amazing spectacle!

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.920
All four forwards brought out Avatars?

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:22.870
The Avatar-powered shoot advances towards Raimon's goal!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:24.580
You won't get it in!

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.020
Fence Of Gaia!

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.900
He blocks it!

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.950
Sangoku desperately blocks the Avatar shoot!

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.330
He did it!

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.230
Sangoku-senpai!

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:44.140
Oh, not bad.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:44.960
But...

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.850
The real hell is just starting!

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.970
Another Avatar shoot!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:54.110
Fence Of Gaia!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:02:59.220
Sangoku!

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.490
Sangoku desperately makes the save!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.270
But he's been blown back!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.660
And another Avatar shoot!

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.410
I won't make it!

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:10.520
Amagi!

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:21.410
Atlantis Wall!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.770
Amagi dives in, but he can't stop it!

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.030
It's lost power!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:31.640
Now!

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.630
I suppose you would call that a beautiful combo play.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:42.650
But that has no strength to withstand us, Dragon Link!

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:44.910
I'll block it!

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:50.330
Sangoku-senpai!

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:57.370
Sangoku blocks the ball as his body smashes against the goalpost!

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.360
Are you okay, Sangoku?!

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:05.410
So he was able to block that attack.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.010
Well, shows that they didn't make it all the way to the finals by pure luck.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:13.940
Sangoku departs the field after protecting the goal even with wounds all over his body.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.780
So this is Dragon Link.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.210
Shinsuke, switch in.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.820
Protect the goal.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:22.320
Yes, sir!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.410
In Sangoku's place, Nishizono will be covering the goal.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:28.810
We're counting on you, Shinsuke.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.080
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:34.030
All four forwards can use Avatars...

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:36.860
That's some terrifying attack power.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.740
How are we supposed to go up against those forwards?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.420
If they shoot at us with multiple Avatar attacks again...

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:46.510
There's a way.

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:51.570
We'll bring up the offense and fight deep into the opponent's side of the field.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:56.240
As long as the forwards don't get the ball, I'm sure things will work.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.190
Is it that easy?

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.120
There's too much of a risk.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.630
If we get countered, what then?

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.800
Yeah, what if that happens?

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.330
Well...

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.010
That plan sounds fine with me.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:10.420
Tenma's the captain.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.490
Let's go with what he says.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.660
Kurumada-senpai.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.370
Don't worry. Even if they get through, we'll catch up to stop them.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.560
That's right.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.860
No point mulling over it.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:24.080
Let's just think about winning.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:25.800
Yeah, that's true.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.710
All right.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.470
Let's go!

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:36.170
The match resumes!

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.130
Seidouzan has the corner kick!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.040
I'll stop you!

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.240
You're in the way!

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.320
Gotou wins over Kirino in a faceoff!

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:53.950
Kurumada dives in and steals the ball!

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:55.430
All right!

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:56.760
Now!

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.510
Everyone, go up!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.870
Now it's Raimon's turn to attack!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.440
You won't get past us!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:03.680
Kurama-kun!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:04.420
No you don't!

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.070
All right, here we come!

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:10.100
Raimon comes up in one stroke.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.640
They're tearing through Seidouzan's territory!

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:18.270
They're keeping the ball on the opponent's side of the field to not give the forwards a chance to use their Avatars?

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:18.850
Tenma...

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:27.540
They're able to keep up the plays without letting the forwards get the ball.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:28.440
It's working!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:29.520
Matsukaze!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.800
Why, you!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.030
Soyokaze Step!

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:39.580
Matsukaze breaks through the defense!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.460
He's one-on-one with the goalkeeper!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.840
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.180
Go!

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.310
Get off your high horse, you pests!

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.000
Come out!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.950
Wise Sovereign Kingburn!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.000
King Fire!

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:29.170
The goalkeeper is an Avatar user too?

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.550
You don't know <i>anything.</i>

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:38.000
Every one of us eleven in Dragon Link is an Avatar user.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:59.120
U-Unbelievable! Everyone in Seidouzan has unleashed an Avatar!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:00.930
This can't be happening!

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:02.880
Now that's quite a sight.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:05.880
That's...!

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:07.590
We were too late!

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:13.050
We'll have you learn the terror that is Dragon Link!

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:14.800
Matsukaze!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.050
Watch out!

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:21.690
Kurama-senpai!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.670
They can't be...!

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:33.490
They're using Avatar shoots as passes!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.260
You can't possibly stop us!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.080
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:51.340
The super soccer army, Fifth Sector's final weapon.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.800
That's us, Dragon Link!

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:58.770
Majin The Hand!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.960
I-It's in!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:11.160
Seidouzan brings up the ball with Avatar shoots and ends it at Raimon's goal!

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:14.200
They're all Avatar users...

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.740
Is this the soccer Senguuji Daigo wants?

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:29.580
We weren't able to tell Endou-kun the secret of Dragon Link.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:32.210
No point in crying over spilled milk.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.420
Fudou-kun!

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.560
Kazemaru and Kabeyama are here too.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.230
You all came!

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:40.700
The future of soccer depends on this, after all.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:45.230
We have a duty to oversee this match no matter how it plays out.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.420
Are you okay, Kurama?

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:54.030
Kurama-senpai!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.450
Hikaru, switch in for Kurama. You're up!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:09:58.770
Yes, sir!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:03.580
Raimon switches out Kurama for Kageyama!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.290
This makes the second injured player!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.320
Senpai...

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:09.100
Don't make that face.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.580
The team can't stay together without its captain.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:14.590
I just prevented that from happening.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.470
Take care of the rest.

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:24.960
They got ahead of us again.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:29.470
I can't believe all of them are Avatar users.

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:31.520
Dragon Link...

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:35.620
How are we supposed to face up to those guys?

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:41.750
I have to do something!

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:42.970
Something...

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:49.460
I know! If they use Avatars, then we'll have to fight back with Avatars too.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:52.330
Fight Avatars with Avatars?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:56.330
But all eleven of them use Avatars.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.390
But there's only one ball.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:03.500
If we hit the Avatar who has the ball with our Avatars, then I'm sure it'll work out.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.590
Hit Avatars with Avatars?

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.430
But that's...

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:14.240
Nishiki-senpai, Tsurugi, Shinsuke, is that okay?

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.030
Sounds like a good challenge!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.030
All right.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:19.940
Yeah.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.400
All right, let's do it!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.600
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:26.380
GO!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:31.200
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.030
GO!

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.560
Can Raimon catch up?

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:37.920
The match resumes!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:39.590
Let's go!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.260
Okay!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.250
Now, Tsurugi!

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:00.280
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:05.280
Tsurugi has released his Avatar to fight against Gotou's Avatar!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.230
It's a clash of Avatars!

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.960
Nice block, Tsurugi!

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:18.300
Nishiki-senpai!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.110
I got it!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.970
Sengoku War God Musashi!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.850
Nishiki-senpai, that's the way!

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.570
Piece of cake!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:44.950
Is he trying to stop them by pitting Avatars against each other?

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.140
No, Tenma!

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.870
Fighting like that won't...!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.740
Let's see...

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.380
Shindou-san?

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.730
Shindou-san, where are you going?

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.900
I have to tell him.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:11.320
There's something I have to tell Tenma!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:13.160
Are you trying to go to the stadium?

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:14.350
No!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.910
You're not in any condition to be moving around!

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:18.740
I'm the only one...

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.820
I'm the only one who can tell him!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.690
You have to let me go!

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.210
Shindou-san...

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:32.670
For your friends, right?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:37.730
After seeing that look on your face, I know I can't stop you.

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:42.630
But I can't let you go by yourself.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:45.900
I'll bring you to the stadium.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:53.010
Lost Angel!

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.900
King Fire!

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:10.920
He blocks it!

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:14.650
Senguuji Yamato easily stops Tsurugi's Avatar shoot!

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:21.500
It's mine!

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:26.800
Majin The Hand!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:38.510
I've got it!

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:49.060
Nishiki-senpai!

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.470
All right! Great defense, Nishiki!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:55.790
But they've been getting pushed around this whole time.

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:57.370
Eat this!

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.380
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.380
Majin The Hand!

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.000
All right! Good work, Shinsuke!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:19.560
Yeah!

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.560
Matsukaze, are you sure we should keep doing this?

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:30.160
We only have four Avatars, but they have eleven.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.780
At this rate, they'll drive us in.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.040
It'll be okay.

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:39.110
For now, we just need to hit their Avatars with ours to stop their attacks.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:41.170
They'll surely exhaust themselves eventually.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.300
If we attack when that happens, we can bring it back to a tie.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:51.260
Kamiyama from Seidouzan makes a throw-in to resume the game!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.930
It's coming, Tsurugi!

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.020
Yeah!

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:02.730
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:08.030
Sengoku War God Musashi!

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:09.140
Nishiki-senpai!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.820
Sorry, Tenma...

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:21.740
I don't have the power bring out my Avatar anymore...

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.540
Nishiki-senpai, too?

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:31.240
You guys can't bring out your Avatar for very long without going through the practice for it like we have!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:37.040
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.000
This'll finish it!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:45.420
Senpai!

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:47.190
Even if we can't use Avatars...

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.440
We'll stop it!

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.870
Atlantis Wall!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.540
Amagi and Kurumada make a desperate block!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.790
But the Avatar shoot blows them back!

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:15.510
The ball hits the goalpost!

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:17.260
You stubborn guys!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:18.970
I won't let it through!

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:23.230
Kirino uses his body for a do-or-die defense!

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:24.600
Kirino-senpai!

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:26.860
Kariya!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:30.110
I can do it when the time calls for it too!

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:35.000
The shoot hits the goalpost again!

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.200
Raimon's desperate defense narrowly protects the goal!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.660
Guys!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.090
Tenma-kun!

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:44.470
It's only a matter of time before they finish us!

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:48.990
Tsurugi-kun and Nishiki-senpai can't use their Avatars anymore.

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:51.450
What should we do, Tenma-kun?

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:53.630
Hikaru...

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.960
Hurry and give us your orders, Captain!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:02.540
It takes everyone to protect the goal, huh...

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:05.680
What a waste.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:07.820
You call this your soccer?

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:13.820
The goalkeeper, Senguuji Yamato, has come up to Raimon's goal!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:18.320
I'll finish your soccer right here, right now!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.590
Come out!

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.070
Wise Sovereign Kingburn!

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:31.700
I'll stop you!

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:35.190
I'll stop you!

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:38.970
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.250
A revolutionary wind, you call it?

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:46.610
I'll break it apart!

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:51.780
Tenma!

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:52.430
Kageyama-kun!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.540
I'll protect the goal!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:01.050
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:08.980
Senguuji Yamato's shoot makes it in!

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:10.580
That makes it 4-2!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:16.120
Raimon has been hit with a severe point difference late into the second half!

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:21.910
Guys!

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:27.170
The Raimon Eleven are unable to stand back up after taking on the ferocious attack!

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:31.940
It's my fault.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:35.860
What have I done?

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:45.850
Captain Shindou would always give everyone orders no matter what happened and guide everyone to victory.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:51.210
We've been able to win all this time because the captain was there.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:56.960
But I've only brought the team to shambles.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.410
I'm an idiot...

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:04.010
It was my idea to fight Avatars with Avatars...

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:07.200
I didn't even realize everyone was getting exhausted.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.130
Who was I to think things would just work out?

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:13.890
Everyone did their best.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:17.920
<i>They</i>  were the ones trying to make things work out!

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:22.800
I was just being supported by their efforts...

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:25.030
As their captain, it's supposed to be the other way around!

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:29.870
It was a big mistake to just think things would work out.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.880
So this is the end of Raimon as well.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.010
Do you finally see now?

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.660
Fifth Sector's soccer is the rightful cause.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.090
There is no point in rebelling.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:48.070
This makes it complete.

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:51.910
The perfect soccer under perfect management.

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:55.250
How the heck am I captain?

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.480
I made the team fall apart!

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:02.430
I fail as a captain!

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:07.320
The team can't win when I'm the captain!

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:08.960
Tenma!

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:11.820
Matsukaze Tenma!

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.380
Captain Shindou...

